# Screen captures of a real machine.
#
# A screenshot of this app is a process inventory: every application running,
# with pids and start times. That identifies the machine it came from, and it
# is the exact thing FR-029 and A-05 forbid the app itself from transmitting.
# Verification captures stay local; the design renders in design/screens/ show
# every screen with invented data and are what belongs in the repo.
screenshots/
